===== Notes =====
Known differences between Hardware VR2600/VR2600v and C2600
  * Flash chip used in VR2600v is smaller (16MB)
  * Flash layout (partitions) are different

  * https://forum.openwrt.org/t/need-full-dump-tp-link-archer-vr2600-installation/48081/5
  * https://forum.openwrt.org/t/ipq806x-lede-support-for-tp-link-archer-vr2600v/326/17
  * The labelled LAN ports do not correspond to the LAN ports as seen within 21.02.3 LuCI. [[https://github.com/openwrt/openwrt/issues/10275|Bug Report 10275]]  Fixed in 21.02.4 and 22.03.0.
  * The VR2600/VR2600V is known to suffer from [[:toh:tp-link:archer_c2600_v1#sporadic_reboots]] as seen on similar TP-Link C2600.  A partial fix for IPQ806x implemented from 23.05.0 [[commit>?p=openwrt/openwrt.git;a=commit;h=6f5ea752d7c95ba426ca21a6588cae8812bb3e7c|Commit]]
  * There has been reports of wifi problems with the TP-Link C2600 in the past with early CT wifi drivers, so you may wish to install [[:toh:tp-link:archer_c2600_v1#alternative_wifi_module_and_firmware]]
